        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "[UR]: US$ 5258–32 040/DALY averted), which was considered cost effective at a willingness-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.9635009765625,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "to-pay (WTP) threshold of three times the country GDP per capita (US$ 15 609), with 80% of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
