      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        140.64878845214844,
        460.3215637207031,
        154.73678588867188
      ],
      "text": "Main findings for PICO 2: Using targeted NGS among those with RR-TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        165.40380859375,
        526.890380859375,
        178.54881286621094
      ],
      "text": "Using targeted NGS as a  among RR-TB patients,  replacement for universal phenotypic DST",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.90380859375,
        527.2891845703125,
        194.04881286621094
      ],
      "text": "targeted NGS was dominated by phenotypic DST, with targeted NGS having higher costs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        196.40380859375,
        526.9635009765625,
        209.54881286621094
      ],
      "text": "and leading to fewer health gains. This finding was driven by the high diagnostic accuracy of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        211.90380859375,
        527.2604370117188,
        225.04881286621094
      ],
      "text": "phenotypic DST (which was assumed to be universal in this scenario), and an assumption of no",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.989595413208008,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.40380859375,
        526.9644165039062,
        240.54881286621094
      ],
      "text": "difference in loss to follow-up between targeted NGS and phenotypic DST. When in-country",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.90380859375,
        526.9777221679688,
        256.048828125
      ],
      "text": "DST practice was used as the comparator (instead of universal phenotypic DST), targeted NGS",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        258.40380859375,
        526.8431396484375,
        271.548828125
      ],
      "text": "led to more health gains than in-country DST across all three countries. Targeted NGS was cost",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.992897987365723,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.90380859375,
        526.9590454101562,
        287.048828125
      ],
      "text": "effective in South Africa (ICER: US$ 15 619/DALY averted, 95% UR: cost saving –US$ 114 782,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        289.40380859375,
        524.4071044921875,
        302.548828125
      ],
      "text": "at a WTP threshold of US$ 21 165), but was not cost effective in Georgia (ICER: US$ 18,375/",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        304.90380859375,
        526.9566650390625,
        318.048828125
      ],
      "text": "DALY averted, UR: cost saving –US$  158 972/DALY averted, at a WTP threshold of US$ 15 065).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.967351913452148,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        320.40380859375,
        526.89306640625,
        333.548828125
      ],
      "text": "In India, where LPA, liquid culture and DST are being used as part of in-country DST, targeted",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.90380859375,
        526.9644775390625,
        349.048828125
      ],
      "text": "NGS dominated the country’s current DST practice, with lower costs and more health gains",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        351.40380859375,
        243.4097900390625,
        364.548828125
      ],
      "text": "(95% UR: cost saving –US$ 60 083).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        376.3913879394531,
        248.65457153320312,
        390.4794006347656
      ],
      "text": "Main findings: scenario analyses",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.14642333984375,
        526.991943359375,
        414.29144287109375
      ],
      "text": "Several key scenario analyses were investigated. In the base case approach, loss to follow-up",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        416.64642333984375,
        526.698486328125,
        429.79144287109375
      ],
      "text": "was assumed to be equivalent between phenotypic DST and targeted NGS; in a scenario where",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970561027526855,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        432.14642333984375,
        526.9376220703125,
        445.29144287109375
      ],
      "text": "there was no loss to follow-up in targeted NGS compared with 10% in phenotypic DST, targeted",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.945363998413086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        447.64642333984375,
        526.9490966796875,
        460.79144287109375
      ],
      "text": "NGS was cost effective in South Africa (ICER: US$ 13 004/DALY averted, WTP: US$ 21 165) and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.993597984313965,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        463.14642333984375,
        526.9923706054688,
        476.29144287109375
      ],
      "text": "Georgia (ICER: US$ 13 640/DALY averted, WTP: US$ 15 069) and targeted NGS still dominated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.991246223449707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        478.64642333984375,
        527.2426147460938,
        491.79144287109375
      ],
      "text": "in-country DST practice in India. In scenarios where sequencing platforms are used for multiple",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.981985092163086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        494.14642333984375,
        526.5777587890625,
        507.29144287109375
      ],
      "text": "different diseases to reduce the unit test cost of targeted NGS, the cost–effectiveness of targeted",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        509.64642333984375,
        526.9921264648438,
        522.7914428710938
      ],
      "text": "NGS improves in all three countries. A batching scenario was investigated, with an assumed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        525.1464233398438,
        526.9148559570312,
        538.2914428710938
      ],
      "text": "20% fewer samples per targeted NGS run, and led to an increased unit test cost for targeted",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        540.6464233398438,
        526.995361328125,
        553.7914428710938
      ],
      "text": "NGS; in this scenario, the targeted NGS approach retained cost–effectiveness only in South",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        556.1464233398438,
        526.96240234375,
        569.2914428710938
      ],
      "text": "Africa. When a 50% price reduction in targeted NGS test kit cost was assumed, targeted NGS",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        571.6464233398438,
        322.26739501953125,
        584.7914428710938
      ],
      "text": "cost–effectiveness further improved in all countries.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        595.8043212890625,
        527.4390258789062,
        608.7183227539062
      ],
      "text": "Objective 2: To assess the financial impact of introducing targeted NGS as a replacement",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 10.990145683288574,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.3043212890625,
        527.3579711914062,
        624.2183227539062
      ],
      "text": "for existing DST for diagnosis of DR-TB among TB patients across three countries: Georgia,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 10.947274208068848,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        626.8043212890625,
        190.43508911132812,
        639.7183227539062
      ],
      "text": "India and South Africa.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        650.6541748046875,
        526.7632446289062,
        663.7991943359375
      ],
      "text": "A budget impact assessment was undertaken to estimate the financial consequences of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        666.1541748046875,
        526.9370727539062,
        679.2991943359375
      ],
      "text": "adopting targeted NGS for DST for all patients diagnosed with TB, and replacing in-country",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        681.6541748046875,
        526.9479370117188,
        694.7991943359375
      ],
      "text": "DST practice in Georgia (PICO 1). The analysis suggested that implementing targeted NGS for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        697.1541748046875,
        526.9149780273438,
        710.2991943359375
      ],
      "text": "all patients diagnosed with TB would be more expensive than testing all patients with Xpert",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        712.6542358398438,
        412.1683044433594,
        725.7992553710938
      ],
      "text": "MTB/RIF or Xpert Ultra, followed by phenotypic DST (see  ). Fig. 2.4.5.2",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        556.809326171875,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 111",
